    "title": "Makhana vs. Popcorn: Why Roasted Makhana is India’s New Superfood Champion",
    "slug": "makhana-vs-popcorn-indias-superfood-champion",
    "category": "Makhana",
    "author": "Veyano Team",
    "image_url": "./assets/makhana_vs_popcorn_chart.png",
