    "excerpt": "Did you know that Makhana, also known as Fox Nuts or Gorgon Nuts, has been a staple in Ayurvedic medicine for centuries? At Veyano, we believe in bringing this ancient wisd...",
    "content": "\n    <h2>Beyond Just a Snack: The Veyano Perspective</h2>\n    <p>Did you know that Makhana, also known as Fox Nuts or Gorgon Nuts, has been a staple in Ayurvedic medicine for centuries? At Veyano, we believe in bringing this ancient wisdom to the modern snacker without compromising on taste or quality.</p>\n    \n    <h3>1. Zero Guilt, Maximum Crunch</h3>\n    <p>Unlike potato chips or extruded puffs, Makhana is naturally gluten-free and very low in calories. It is heart-healthy, high in magnesium, and contains an anti-aging enzyme called kaempferol.</p>\n    \n    <h3>2. Perfect for Every Diet</h3>\n    <p>Whether you're following a Vegan diet, Keto, or just looking for a cleaner alternative for your kids, Veyano Makhana fits right in. We never fry our nuts; we slow-roast them to maintain their structural integrity and nutritional profile.</p>\n    \n    <blockquote>\"Snacking should nourish you, not just fill a void. That's the Veyano promise.\"</blockquote>\n    \n    <h3>3. The Veyano Roasting Process</h3>\n    <p>We source only the highest grade of Fox Nuts from the heart of Bihar. Our roasting process uses minimal heat to preserve the protein content while ensuring each nut has that signature \"Veyano Pop\".</p>\n    \n    <p>Explore our flavors today and transform your tea-time ritual!</p>\n  "
